  "nodeBodies": [
    {
      "name": "言语理解",
      "nodeId": "50de7612-b716-4991-9db6-cf17f8fc8919",
      "parentId": null,
      "markdown": "语言文字理解与表达的整体知识框架。"
    },
    {
      "name": "逻辑填空",
      "nodeId": "91a872da-c09d-4bdf-99c6-4239903d9f02",
      "parentId": "50de7612-b716-4991-9db6-cf17f8fc8919",
      "markdown": "从上下文逻辑关系、词语搭配和语义色彩定位答案。"
    },
    {
      "name": "语境分析",
      "nodeId": "23662df4-c31b-46b5-913a-2bd5aca0184a",
      "parentId": "91a872da-c09d-4bdf-99c6-4239903d9f02",
      "markdown": "**判断语境提示**：先找转折、递进、解释与照应。\n\n- 看逻辑连接词\n- 识别作者态度\n- 比较语义侧重"
    },
    {
      "name": "词义辨析",
      "nodeId": "45378684-34ca-49c1-8717-7807f1541f22",
      "parentId": "91a872da-c09d-4bdf-99c6-4239903d9f02",
      "markdown": "比较词义轻重、适用对象、搭配与感情色彩。"
    },
    {
      "name": "固定搭配",
      "nodeId": "942fc63e-8eab-4a0e-930b-bf9f477f6806",
      "parentId": "91a872da-c09d-4bdf-99c6-4239903d9f02",
      "markdown": "结合常见搭配和语法关系确认词语。"
    },
    {
      "name": "片段阅读",
      "nodeId": "1592dc1b-d6f6-411a-bf71-8d57b03146b6",
      "parentId": "50de7612-b716-4991-9db6-cf17f8fc8919",
      "markdown": "关注中心句、转折关系、主旨与意图。"
    },
    {
      "name": "主旨概括",
      "nodeId": "7213509b-beb1-45c7-a0bd-d8fe1af409aa",
      "parentId": "1592dc1b-d6f6-411a-bf71-8d57b03146b6",
      "markdown": "找到作者重点论述的对象与观点。"
    },
    {
      "name": "意图判断",
      "nodeId": "f971a23a-b728-4fa1-aa46-e5adc3c4957a",
      "parentId": "1592dc1b-d6f6-411a-bf71-8d57b03146b6",
      "markdown": "区分主要问题、原因与对策，不机械套用“提出对策”。"
    },
    {
      "name": "语句表达",
      "nodeId": "6386ffd3-4205-4851-a518-ecf6bddefa06",
      "parentId": "50de7612-b716-4991-9db6-cf17f8fc8919",
      "markdown": "语句排序与衔接，注重指代、逻辑和话题一致。"
    },
    {
      "name": "创新理论",
      "nodeId": "16be9b51-f4c1-402d-bc08-fbdfe6ae36be",
      "parentId": null,
      "markdown": "创新驱动与现代化发展知识体系。"
    },
    {
      "name": "新发展理念",
      "nodeId": "722f3202-aa50-4da5-8bc1-54301c499f00",
      "parentId": "16be9b51-f4c1-402d-bc08-fbdfe6ae36be",
      "markdown": "创新、协调、绿色、开放、共享。"
    },
    {
      "name": "共享发展",
      "nodeId": "ad0f26ed-7453-41db-9869-8255396564e3",
      "parentId": "16be9b51-f4c1-402d-bc08-fbdfe6ae36be",
      "markdown": "发展成果由人民共享。"
    }
  ],
